title: WIP Limits
flightlevel: FL2

# `wip:` caps work-in-progress per column. A single number is the MAX only
# (renders as a bare count, e.g. `3`); a `[min, max]` list is a range (renders
# `min..max`, e.g. `1..2`). Both forms appear below.
columns:
  - Backlog
  - name: Doing
    wip: 3
  - name: Review
    wip: [1, 2]
  - Done
